    "No Jamf Pro answers for this ID, so its MDM is probably Jamf School: Jamf School is read with a School API key, in its own Jamf School workspace. " : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jamf Pro antwortet für diese ID nicht, daher ist ihr MDM wahrscheinlich Jamf School: Jamf School wird mit einem School-API-Schlüssel in einem eigenen Jamf School-Arbeitsbereich gelesen. "
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ningún Jamf Pro responde a este ID, por lo que su MDM probablemente es Jamf School: Jamf School se lee con una clave de API de School, en su propio espacio de trabajo de Jamf School. "
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aucun Jamf Pro ne répond pour cet ID, donc son MDM est probablement Jamf School : Jamf School se lit avec une clé API School, dans son propre espace de travail Jamf School. "
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nessuna risposta da Jamf Pro per questo ID: il relativo MDM è probabilmente Jamf School. Jamf School si legge con una chiave API di School, in un proprio spazio di lavoro Jamf School.  "
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このIDに応答するJamf Proはないため、MDMはおそらくJamf Schoolです。Jamf SchoolはSchool APIキーを使い、専用のJamf Schoolワークスペースで読み取ります。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nenhum Jamf Pro responde a este ID, então o MDM dele provavelmente é o Jamf School: o Jamf School é lido com uma chave de API do School, em um espaço de trabalho próprio do Jamf School. "
          }
        }
      }
    },
